<title>UK: BRAZIL'S UNIBANCO SETS $250 MLN 3-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>BRAZIL'S UNIBANCO SETS $250 MLN 3-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNIBANCO (UNIAO DE BANCOS BRASILEIROS SA)</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     7.75 PCT  MATURITY    14.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.972    PAY DATE   L12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  45 BP     REOFFER    99.972    SPREAD	+175 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    L-LONG LAST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/CY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
